    <dashboard enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Chapter 1 Dashboard'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='6900' maxwidth='1400' minheight='6900' minwidth='1400' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='100000' id='88' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone h='100000' id='68' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='5800' id='60' param='horz' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='4414'>
                <zone fixed-size='772' forceUpdate='true' h='5800' id='34' is-fixed='true' type-v2='text' w='56000' x='0' y='4414'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='20'>GLOBAL GAMING</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='12'>A data-driven journey through the evolution of the global video game industry.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>From arcade classics to modern blockbusters, video games have evolved through technological innovation, changing player preferences, and fierce competition between platforms.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Using more than five decades of industry data, this project explores how regions, genres, consoles, publishers, and critical reception shaped the way the world plays.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>One industry. Four regions. Countless ways to play.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#998982' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
