              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3420' id='61' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='10678'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>THE GOLDEN ERA OF GAMING</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>When did gaming become a global phenomenon?</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>For decades, the video game industry expanded through two powerful forces:</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>more games being released and steadily increasing commercial success.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>This chapter explores how those trends evolved over time.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                </formatted-text>
