              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2174' id='72' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='25836'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>The industry&apos;s commercial peak wasn&apos;t driven simply by releasing more games.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>It was fueled by blockbuster titles that generated record-breaking sales,</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>showing that quality and scale eventually outweighed quantity.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
