              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4290' id='74' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='28474'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>REGIONAL PREFERENCES</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>The Same Industry.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>Four Different Tastes.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Although video games are a global industry,</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>each region developed remarkably different genre preferences.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>These differences reveal that success wasn&apos;t driven by a universal audience,</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>but by distinct gaming cultures around the world.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
