              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2290' id='91' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='55619'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Market leadership rarely lasted more than a single console generation.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>The industry&apos;s biggest shifts weren&apos;t driven by new genres,</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>but by entirely new hardware ecosystems replacing previous market leaders.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='32' h='464' id='92' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='100000' x='0' y='57909'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                  <format attr='background-color' value='#998982' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3710' id='93' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='58373'>
                <formatted-text>
                  <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                  <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>PUBLISHER LANDSCAPE</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>One Industry. Many Winning Strategies.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Some publishers built their success by releasing hundreds of games,</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>while others dominated the industry with a smaller number of blockbuster titles.</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Comparing total sales with average sales per game reveals</run>
                  <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>very different business strategies across the gaming industry.</run>
                </formatted-text>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                  <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                  <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                  <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                </zone-style>
              </zone>
              <zone fixed-size='12' h='174' id='94' is-fixed='true' type-v2='empty' w='100000' x='0' y='62083'>
                <zone-style>
                  <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
