                <zone fixed-size='772' forceUpdate='true' h='5800' id='34' type-v2='text' w='56000' x='0' y='4414'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='20'>GLOBAL GAMING</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='12'>A data-driven journey through the evolution of the global video game industry.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>From arcade classics to modern blockbusters, video games have evolved through technological innovation, changing player preferences, and fierce competition between platforms.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Using more than five decades of industry data, this project explores how regions, genres, consoles, publishers, and critical reception shaped the way the world plays.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>One industry. Four regions. Countless ways to play.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#998982' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5eddce7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='594' forceUpdate='true' h='5800' id='45' type-v2='text' w='44000' x='56000' y='4414'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='20'>PROJECT OVERVIEW               </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>1971–2024                    </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>64,016 </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Games</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>81 </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Platforms</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>20 </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Genres</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>4 </run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Major Regions</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Built with • PostgreSQL  • Tableau • Figma</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#998982' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5eddce7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3420' id='61' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='10678'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>THE GOLDEN ERA OF GAMING</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>When did gaming become a global phenomenon?</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>For decades, the video game industry expanded through two powerful forces:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>more games being released and steadily increasing commercial success.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>This chapter explores how those trends evolved over time.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='5681' id='65' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 1 - Sales Timeline' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='14272'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='130' minwidth='159' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='5681' id='67' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 1 - Games Released' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='20054'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='130' minwidth='166' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2174' id='72' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='25836'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>The industry&apos;s commercial peak wasn&apos;t driven simply by releasing more games.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>It was fueled by blockbuster titles that generated record-breaking sales,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>showing that quality and scale eventually outweighed quantity.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4290' id='74' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='28474'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>REGIONAL PREFERENCES</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>The Same Industry.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>Four Different Tastes.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Although video games are a global industry,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>each region developed remarkably different genre preferences.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>These differences reveal that success wasn&apos;t driven by a universal audience,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>but by distinct gaming cultures around the world.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='6391' id='77' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 2 - Heatmap' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='32938'>
                  <layout-cache type-h='fixed' type-w='cell' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2594' id='82' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='39430'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Japan stands apart with Role-Playing games dominating its market,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>while North America, Europe and Other regions strongly favor Sports,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Action and Shooter titles.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Global gaming isn&apos;t one market—it is four distinct gaming cultures.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3870' id='84' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='42488'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>GENERATIONS CHANGED EVERYTHING</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>Every major console generation reshaped what millions of players wanted to play.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Console generations didn&apos;t simply introduce better hardware.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Each new platform shifted player behavior, redefined market leaders,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>and transformed the competitive landscape of the gaming industry.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='8696' id='86' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 3 - Stacked Area Chart ' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='46822'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='155' minwidth='159' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#fafafa' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2290' id='91' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='55619'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Market leadership rarely lasted more than a single console generation.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>The industry&apos;s biggest shifts weren&apos;t driven by new genres,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>but by entirely new hardware ecosystems replacing previous market leaders.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3710' id='93' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='58373'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>PUBLISHER LANDSCAPE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>One Industry. Many Winning Strategies.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Some publishers built their success by releasing hundreds of games,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>while others dominated the industry with a smaller number of blockbuster titles.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Comparing total sales with average sales per game reveals</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>very different business strategies across the gaming industry.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='9420' id='95' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 4 - Publisher Landscape' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='62257'>
                  <layout-cache minheight='155' minwidth='177' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <_.fcp.DashboardRoundedCorners.true...format attr='corner-radius' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#fafafa' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2174' id='97' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='71778'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>High total sales don&apos;t always come from consistently successful games.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Publishers like Nintendo achieved both exceptional total sales and high average performance,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>while others relied on releasing a much larger catalog to reach similar commercial success.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='250' forceUpdate='true' h='3623' id='100' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='74416'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='18'>●</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>CRITICAL ACCLAIM VS COMMERCIAL SUCCESS</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='26'>Great reviews don&apos;t always create best-selling games.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>Critical acclaim and commercial success often go hand in hand,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>but not always.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>By comparing review scores with global sales,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='16'>we can explore whether outstanding games consistently became commercial hits—or if other factors shaped success.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone fixed-size='280' h='10145' id='102' is-fixed='true' name='Chapter 5 — Critical Acclaim vs Commercial Success' show-title='false' w='100000' x='0' y='78213'>
                  <layout-cache has-max-size-h='true' has-max-size-w='true' maxheight='809' maxwidth='1596' minheight='809' minwidth='1596' type-h='scalable' type-w='scalable' />
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#fafafa' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2594' id='103' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='88459'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>KEY INSIGHT</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Strong reviews increase the chances of commercial success,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>but they are far from the only factor.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>Marketing, platform availability, franchise recognition,</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='16'>and timing often played just as important a role in creating blockbuster titles.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#efebe8' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8193' id='124' type-v2='text' w='50714' x='0' y='91807'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='24'>THANK YOU FOR READING</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='24'> How the World Plays 1971 — 2024</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='20'>PROJECT AT A GLANCE</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>64,016 games analyzed </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>1971–2024 </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>5 analytical chapters </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>SQL-first workflow </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>Built with Tableau &amp; Figma</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='20'>Methodology</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Armenian' fontsize='16'>Data preparation and aggregation were performed in PostgreSQL. Visualizations were designed in Figma and developed in Tableau Public using chapter-specific datasets.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#9d7660' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5eddc' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8193' id='125' type-v2='text' w='49286' x='50714' y='91807'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='24'>END OF ANALYSIS</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>Video games evolved through changing technologies,</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>shifting player preferences, and fierce competition between platforms.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#606b76' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='18'>Yet one thing remained constant:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='20'>Every generation found its own way to play.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Data Source: VGChartz (1971–2024)</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Designed &amp; Developed by</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#f28e2b' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>Ezequiel Gonzalez</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Noto Sans Georgian Bold' fontsize='14'>SQL • PostgreSQL • Tableau • Figma</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#9d7660' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='4' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5eddc' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='0' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#f5f1ea' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{D22B17FE-E438-46E8-9406-8FE63202C22C}' />
